window.products.push({"id":909079,"name":"New Version Liquid Filling Machine for Perfume Drink Water Milk Oil Filling Machine Bottle Vial Filler 5-3500ml with foot pedal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W+8tr8kJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"New Version Digital Liquid Filling Machine   This is new version filling machine ,and we have improved the machine fully . We have fixed all the problems which possibly happen in the old version filling machine . The new version filling machine will be much better than the old version filling machien ,and also better than other mini liquid filling machines .   Introduction  Controled by micro-computer, fill liquid by setting the filling time and speed. Filling Liquid From 3-3000ml very precisely. Digital Panel, very easy to operate. Voltage AC 180V-260V Power (w): 30 Filling Range (ml): 5-3500 Max. Flow Rate (L/min): 3.2 Package Size (mm): 210X140X100 Weight (kg): 3 Max. Suck Distance: 2meter Anti-dripping Funtion Available Interior diameter of filling nozzle 5mm .  Setting and Operation If the machine is on working status, all other buttons will not be functional, you’ll have to press the on/off button to pause it first.　 -1, How to set the filling volume ? The filling time decides the filling volume .Thus we actually should set the filling time . - Press “program option button” It can switch between 6 different setting records, which you can configure and save to cope with different filling requirements. - below the LED panel, these are Parameter exchange button & parameter choice button & Increase & Decrease buttons ,and they are used for setting  -After you finish the setting, then long press the parameter set button to save the settings. -2, how to operate the machine  - continuing /inching button : it's used to switch to manul and automatic. The pedal is required in manual mode and the interval setting will be ignored. -On/Off button : press On to run filling ,and press Off to stop it .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W+8tr8kJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YTK","source_asin":"B07VXL3K47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VXL3K47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VXL3K47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909080,"name":"Vintage Traditional Portuguese Aluminum Rooster Bottle Stopper Made in Portugal (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE0WtuFlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"As the story goes, back in the middle ages the people of Barcelos were deeply concerned about an unsolved crime. When a stranger from Galicia arrived in town, claiming to be en route to Santiago de Compostela in Spain, the finger of blame was pointed at him. He, of course, protested his innocence but he was sentenced to death by hanging. In a bid to avoid this fate, he begged to see the judge who had passed the sentence. The judge happened to be eating dinner with some friends when the Galician arrived. The condemned man pointed to a roasted cockerel on the dinner table and declared that “It is as certain that I am innocent as it is certain that this rooster will crow when they hang me.” Needless to say, he was laughed out of the room and dragged off to his fate. The official and his friends decided against eating the bird but they were still taken aback when the cockerel actually stood up and crowed, proving the man’s innocence. Realizing his mistake, the judge rushed to the gallows to try and prevent the innocent man from being hanged. By the time he arrived, however, the Galician was dangling from a rope. Luckily, the knot had been badly tied, saving the man’s life. The judge ordered him to be cut down immediately and freed. O Galo de Barcelos is the unofficial symbol of Portugal. In any curio or tourist shop you will find the symbol represented by a ceramic rooster and in the motif embroidered in towels, aprons, stamped on key chains, paper weights, etc. Because of its lively colors, the Rooster of Barcelos is difficult to miss where ever it appears. The motif seems to embody the love of life displayed by the Portuguese people. The symbol has its genesis in the history of Barcelos. The city of Barcelos is located just east of Braga. Even though it is not on a major highway, it still is a good sized city. The legend of the Rooster is so old that no one knows for sure its real source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE0WtuFlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ibergift","source_asin":"B06Y47TNX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y47TNX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y47TNX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
