window.products.push({"id":909088,"name":"Asuka Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner, 22000Pa Powerful Stick Vacuum, Rechargeable Battery Vacuum, Up to 48 mins Runtime, 6 in 1 Lightweight Quiet Versa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gEPoTuTkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 【 Asuka New Released 6-in-1 Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner】 22000PA powerful suction + 4 Hours quick charge + 250W brushless motor + Two suction speeds + 48mins max runtime +99% efficiency filtration. 💎 【 22000Pa Powerful Suction & 2 Cleaning Modes】 250W Digital Motor and provides 24000Pa fade-free suction, 2 adjustable modes meet different cleaning demand: Eco-mode absorbs small dust and debris quickly; High mode vacuums stubborn dirt, pet hair that penetrate deep into carpets. Asuka X1 cordless vacuum cleaner is perfect for hardwood floor, low-pile and mid-pile carpet, tile floor, marble floor. 💎 【 Upgraded Filtration System】 Compared with the traditional 4-stage filtration system, Asuka stick vacuum cleaner designed with 5 stages high-efficiency full sealed filtration system, captures large particles and 99.99% micro dust as small as 0.1um, expels ultimate purified air for your family and prevents secondary air pollution. One button to quickly empty the 0.5L large dustbin, no need to touch the dirt. Upgraded k1 vacuum cleaner provides you convenient and excellent cleaning experience. 💎 【 48min Running Time + Detachable Battery】 K1 vacuum cleaner with 2200mAh battery to ensure a cleaning time of up to 48 minutes (NOTE: 15 minutes at high suction and 48 minutes at Eco suction). The battery can be removed and replaced with one button. Fully charged in 4-5 hours. 💎 【 Meet All Cleaning Needs & Make Your Life Easier】K1 stick vacuum cleaner comes with a normal and a mini motorized brush head, a 2 in 1 brush, and a long crevice, they can be easily assembled into 8 combinations for versatile cleanings, like a handheld vacuum which is very suitable for sofas, car, keyboards, and gaps. They are specially designed for Easy Rest which allows you to safely prop the vacuum up on counter tops and furniture. 💎 【 Perfect for Carpet Hard Floor & Ceramic Tiles】 Asuka upgraded vacuum cleaner is suitable for hard carpet floor and ceramic tiles. Built-in independent motor, large fluffy roller brush and front LED light ensures for quick and convenient cleaning. 270° Rotation Brush with LED Light makes your cleaning flexible to horizontal and vertical. 💎 【 Package List for Asuka K1 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner】 Vacuum Main Body + Telescopic Tube + Electric Floor Brush with Plush Roller Bar + HEPA Filter *2 (1pc installed, 1pcs for replacement) + Long Crevice Nozzle + 2-in-1 Bristle Brush + Battery + Adapter + Wall-mounting Bracket + User Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gEPoTuTkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asuka","source_asin":"B09DYJP2PG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYJP2PG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYJP2PG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
