window.products.push({"id":909206,"name":"Mommy’s Sippy Cup | Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler | Mom Cup | Stemless Wine Glasses with Lid & Straw | Best Insulated Wine Tumbler | Mother's Day Gift,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817jRxZ+tdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you been hesitant to give wine glasses as presents because they break easily? Wine glasses are wonderful gifts; they make recipients feel really special. But these items are also extremely fragile. So, you give them as presents only when you’re sure they will go straight to the safety of your recipient's cupboard. That’s not exactly where you want your gift to end up. You prefer to have the special woman in your life to use it as often as she can, or proudly display it. The Hummingbird Collection Wine Tumbler is your durable alternative to breakable wine glasses. Its classy design is sweat- and scratch-proof, and easy to maintain with hand washing. Inside, the double-walled rust-resistant stainless steel is more durable than glass. To top it off is a vacuum-seal lid and silicone straw, which won’t stain or warp like plastic. Our stemless wine cup is more stable and less prone to spills than stemmed glasses. You can use it even in more crowded and busier places, like the workplace or while traveling. This wine glass provides great insulation to keep hot drinks hot and cold beverages cold. Use it for your morning coffee, mix your favorite juice in it at snack time, and drink your water from it through the day. You may not need another glass again! Here are more reasons to replace your stemmed wine glass with The Hummingbird Collection Wine Tumbler: ✔ At 4.5” high and 3” wide, it’s just the right size to fit securely in your hand ✔ It has a capacity of 12 oz./360 ml, which is just enough for holding your favorite drink ✔ Lightweight at 0.4 lb/0.2 kg ✔ With hand washing and proper care, the color and design will not easily wash off ✔ Reusable, helps reduce waste Give the gift of class and durability. Add The Hummingbird Collection Stainless-Steel Wine Tumbler to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817jRxZ+tdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Hummingbird Collection","source_asin":"B07NV3F4PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NV3F4PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NV3F4PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
