window.products.push({"id":909326,"name":"Trevco Irish Flag Officially Licensed Beach Towel 30\" X 60\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517f5XCC-gS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"IRISH FLAG OFFICIALLY LICENSED 30\" X 60\" BEACH TOWEL – This lightweight and compact beach towel is soft and comfortable, breathable, and durable. It is super absorbent to dry you quickly. The front features microfiber polyester for maximum color vibrancy and the back features cotton for maximum absorbency. HAND PRINTED IN THE USA - All our products are hand-printed in the USA using a dye sublimation process that creates slight imperfections over seams and/or folds that are unique to and a part of each item. Printed one-side only. VERSATILE AND EASY CARE - Our beach towels have an unfolded size of 30”x60” making it perfect for both adults and children. It can be used while soaking up the sun at the pool, relaxing at the beach or simply at home. This product makes a great gift for friends, families, or just for yourself! Our products are machine washable. Tumble dry low. DISCLAMER: Towel may arrive flat and thin due to printing process. Fibers will expand after first or second wash. OFFICIALLY LICENSED - Each of our designs are officially licensed and 100% authentic. The designs are created by our incredibly talented in-house graphic art team who often hand draw and illustrate each design. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED - If you are unsatisfied with our product, we will replace it or refund you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517f5XCC-gS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trevco","source_asin":"B07G9QQP87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9QQP87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9QQP87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
