window.products.push({"id":909343,"name":"The Metal Magician Wall Mounted Antique Cast Iron Vintage Style Wall Hooks for Coats, Bags, Towels, Hats - (Set of 3) Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613CEFjGchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The wall hooks made from high quality cast iron, this is a uniquely beautiful yet heavy duty accessory that you can use with confidence throughout your home. Our wall hooks provide an abundance of space for hanging items and getting organized. It is the perfect accent for your hallway, bathroom or closet to hold backpacks, heavy garments, dog leashes, or any other gear you may have. It's ideal to use these rustic coat hooks to make a homemade coat rack for the wall. It has durable and stylish double wall mounted hooks, with hardware included for easy installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613CEFjGchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Metal Magician","source_asin":"B097G3G11W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097G3G11W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097G3G11W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909344,"name":"Koythin Mushroom Mug with Lid, Cute Creative Mushroom Cup Unique Irregular Design for Office and Home, Dishwasher and Microwave Safe, 12 oz/350 ml for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g0acZ+BEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multiple Uses: This coffee mug is the perfect way to start your day. This novelty handmade coffee mug is perfect for drinking coffee, tea or hot chocolate. For Your Daily Requirements: The perfect match for your coffee, milk or tea! Compared to other coffee mugs, the Coffee Mug not only fulfills your coffee needs, but also serves as a saucer for your snack cakes. This coffee mug set is sure to be the perfect addition to your new day! Smooth and Easy-to-clean Glaze: The smooth glaze prevents coffee stains from remaining. Do not worry about coffee leaving stains after sitting too long. Ceramic coffee mugs can be washed with water or in the dishwasher, greatly simplifying your life and saving you time. Unique Design: Handcrafted with irregular shapes, wide cup body and unique handle design, showing a clear attitude to life. With creative coasters, they are a great decoration for your coffee table and you will enjoy your coffee. Notice Before Purchasing: Due to process problems and high temperature firing process, ceramic products occasionally have a small lack of porcelain or small black and white impurities and small protrusions, which does not affect the overall appearance. Because the product is made by manual hand, the appearance capacity of the product will have some differences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g0acZ+BEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koythin","source_asin":"B0BBTYQG75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBTYQG75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBTYQG75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909345,"name":"Artaste 1029093 Rain 18/10 Stainless Steel Dinner Fork, Matte Finish Handle,12-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cPpuz0rwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From gold plating for those special occasions, to wonderfully practical stainless steel for everyday dining, Artaste offers the right cutlery for you. A stylish array of Flatware sets allows you to instantly refresh your dining settings with striking contemporary styles. Flatware is an important investment that enhances the dining experience. Forged from high quality stainless steel, all our flatware is designed for both beauty and durability. Our patterns are made from 18/10 stainless steel. Stainless steel is an alloy, and the 18 indicates that the metal has 18% chromium for durability and hardness. It is called stainless because it literally stains less than any other steel. Forged flatware is made from thick pieces of stainless steel which require the use of heat to cut or shape them. The forging process increases the strength, which causes the flatware to be heavier than stamped pieces. Because our utensils and serving pieces are constructed of high-quality stainless steel, flatware from Artaste is easy to care for. Most of our stainless flatware is dishwasher safe; however, extreme heat, lemon detergents and acidic compounds should be avoided. Whether using the dishwasher or hand washing, dry the flatware as soon as possible to avoid spotting and pitting, especially on the knives. If using a dishwasher, load the utensils and serving pieces loosely and use a spot free rinsing agent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cPpuz0rwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artaste","source_asin":"B09T2QKT8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2QKT8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2QKT8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909346,"name":"Tovolo Flex-Core All Silicone Jumbo Spatula - Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O--9j1VJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing Flex-Core, the new standard in spatulas. We've added a nylon core to the head of our silicone spatula, creating a spatula rigid enough to tackle heavy mixing jobs, yet still flexible on the edges to give you the perfect scrape. Tovolo's Flex-Core All Silicone Spatulas are perfect for the modern chef and are great for working with slippery food prep. These Jumbo All Silicone Spatulas have an ergonomically shaped silicone handle allowing for a comfortable grip; making them perfect for mixing, folding, serving, spreading, scraping and flipping. This oversized spatula works overtime so you don't have to! The completely smooth surface allows for even spreading while the edges are tapered to a sharp point to scrape sides clean. The square corners allow this spatula to fit into tight spots and the angled head is perfect for easy scooping. These sleek, stylish all silicone spatulas will look amazing in any kitchen, match any decor and are dishwasher safe. At Tovolo, we believe time spent cooking should be fun and we are honored to be a part of that experience in each home that uses our products. We challenge ourselves to improve the performance, function, and appearance of kitchen tools. Something as simple as a silicone spatula moves us to create the perfect experience for our customers. We obsess over every detail to ensure that our spatula will outperform expectations. However, performance alone is not enough; we want to put a smile on the customer’s face as well. Whether it is our Spatulart silicone spatulas, our assortment of frozen pop molds or our whimsically shaped ice molds, we strive to add a colorful element of fun to each of our items, to do just that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O--9j1VJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B0748DR24B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0748DR24B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0748DR24B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909347,"name":"PASSENGER PIGEON Zebra Cordless Window Blinds, 33 W x 48 H Inches, Light Grey, Premium Light Filtering Horizontal Day and Night Dual Layer Sheer Blind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uToUjC9bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 3.5inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Solid color roller shade. Feature: 50% Blackout Waterproof Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uToUjC9bL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B075HTFZW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075HTFZW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075HTFZW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
