window.products.push({"id":909357,"name":"Floral Supply Online - Artificial Silk Peony Bouquet for Floral Arrangements, Weddings, and Home Decor. (Violet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v3HjSA-1L._AC_SL1016_.jpg","description":"Peony Bouquets by Floral Supply Online. A trusted brand name proudly owned by an American company and is protected by US Trademark Serial #87585620. Look for the \"Floral Supply Online\" unique logo to ensure authenticity, consistency, and quality. Each hand tied bouquet has five peony blooms on plastic stems and is neatly tied together with twine. 3 of the blooms measure 3.5\" in diameter. 1 Bloom is 2.5\". And 1 partially closed bloom/bud in the middle is about 2\" in diameter. Overall height including stems is about 9\". The blooms open up to measure about 8 inches total width all together. Packaged tight and securely, the blooms will need to be shaped out a little in order to open them up as pictured. It is quick and easy to do!!!! Considering it is artificial flowers, they are very realistic looking and actually priced better. Stunningly beautiful, this silk flower bouquet will prove that its just about as realistic, beautiful and romantic as the more expensive \"fresh flower\" bouquets. All 5 of the blooms spread out enough to make a the bouquet look full and really nice. It even features some leaf petals below the blooms. Very popular with retail florists for weddings, prom, and events. Design a more gorgeous bouquet by adding ribbon, pearls or accents to it. Featuring bendable and realistic-looking plastic stem for easy crafting and placement. It can also be simply displayed in a vase as it is to create a pleasing floral accent to your home, office, or special event. Peonies are a symbol of romance, wealth, prosperity, good fortune, a happy marriage, riches, honor, and compassion. The peony silk flower hand died bouquet makes a great gift idea for that special loved one. Countless decorating ideas with this beautiful bunch of flowers. Simply drop the bouquet in your favorite vase for an instant table centerpiece or floral arrangement. Made of high quality and realistic looking materials. Each bouquet is individually packed in a strong cardboard box for total protection during shipping. Recommended for indoor use - if using outdoors place under a covered area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51v3HjSA-1L._AC_SL1016_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Floral Supply Online","source_asin":"B08RDZ18R8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RDZ18R8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RDZ18R8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
