window.products.push({"id":909450,"name":"Rifle Paper Co. Jardin De Paris Candle for Festive Occasions and Gatherings with Decorative Box and Festive Labels On Soy Candle Base and 40+ Hour Bur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710KxqJHk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Layered and floral, Jardin de Paris plays homage to blooming French gardens and the iconic elements of Parisian style: classic and feminine. The 9.5oz soy wax candle comes in a painted glass vessel and is packaged in a decorative gift box with gold foil accents.Rifle Paper Co. was founded in 2009 by husband-wife team Nathan and Anna Bond. Over the years, the brand has grown from a company of two people to over 150. Rifle Paper Co. continues to thrive with frequent new designs, patterns, and product lines. Their offerings now range from stationery to home décor, writing utensils, apparel, phone and other technology accessories, and more! The Rifle Paper Co. world is full of bold colors, hand-painted florals, and whimsical characters with the goal to create quality products that bring beauty to the everyday.  Anna's hand-painted illustrations and distinctive color palette are the heart of Rifle Paper Co. Anna's love for stationery began when she designed her own wedding invitations and invitations for friends, her love for illustrating stationery turned into the idea to start a brand with a look unlike any other in the market.  Anna (a former freelance illustrator) and Nathan (a former musician) built the brand learning as they went and on the idea that Rifle Paper Co. products should be well-designed, high-quality, and accessible. They currently reside less than 10 minutes from the brand's Winter Park, Florida studio with their three young sons.  As a company, Rifle Paper Co. takes every detail of each product into consideration. This means hand-assembling products in their warehouse, and establishing decade-long relationships with local Florida printers. It is the Rifle Paper Co. passion and purpose to produce quality products that we use ourselves and exceed your expectations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710KxqJHk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIFLE PAPER CO.","source_asin":"B0BKH9BVJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKH9BVJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKH9BVJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
