window.products.push({"id":909506,"name":"LINSY HOME Dresser for Bedroom, Long Dresser with 6 Drawers, Black Chest of Drawers with Metal Handles, Ideal for Living Room, Entryway and Hallway","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o8VG3QtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PREMIUN MATERIAL] - Crafted with CARB P2 & TSCA certified eco-friendly manufactured wood, we do care about your health. Exquisite sealing process gives the dresser a waterproof surface and smooth texture, making it long-lasting. [TIMELESS DESIGN] - Delicate wooden legs, framed drawer fronts and luxurious pull handles add appealing detail to this modern dresser, making it easy to adapt to any decorative style and creating a spacious look for your space. [AMPLE STORAGE SPACE] - With 6 spacious drawers, this double dresser can organize anything from shirts and underwear to diaper and toys. Place it in the bedroom, nursery or anywhere you like, it can be used as a TV stand(Max. load capacity of the Tabletop: 66lbs). [STURDY STRUCTURE] - The bottom cross support structure and wooden frame make this 6 drawer dresser more stable and durable than others which will not deform after several years. Overall dimensions: 15.7\"D x 47.2\"W x 33.5\"H. [SAFETY FIRST] - Wall anchor kit provided to prevent tip-over incidents. Smooth metal runners on each drawer with safety stops prevent drawers from puling out. [ASSEMBLY REQUIRED] - Electric Screwdriver & Two People Recommended. Hardware and assembly instructions included. If you encounter any problems during the assembly process, we are always ready to help. [SATISFACTION GUARANTEE] - LINSY HOME dresser comes with lifetime customer service and 3-year warranty. If you have any question before or after purchase, our customer service is ready to help you within 24h.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o8VG3QtIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0BBMHMDY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBMHMDY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBMHMDY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909507,"name":"10 X 10 X 1 Square Industrial Pizza Stone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MgjnpcZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect pizza stone for the perfect pizza. These are not designer stones that look pretty and crack during the first use. Our Pizza Stones are rough and rugged. They are made of a high grade Non-Toxic Mullite mixture, containing a very high quantity of grog. This makes our Baking Stones virtually indestructible and impervious to thermal shock. 100% Guarantee against cracking and thermal shock. If for any reason one of our pizza or baking stones cracks while using it we will replace it!!! These pizza stones are very porous allowing pizza moisture to be absorbed making for a very crispy crust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MgjnpcZHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Pizza Stones","source_asin":"B073QW4B9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073QW4B9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073QW4B9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":909508,"name":"PAKASEPT 14 Shelves Bookshelf, Ladder Corner Bookshelf, Industrial Vintage Bookshelf, Rustic 5-Tier Display Shelf Storage Organizer for Home Office Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":167.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EAVMda44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ladder Design and Combined Assembly】- Our 14 Shelves Bookshelf contains 10 cube shaped storage space, creating an eye-catching, staircase-style profile. The organized cube structure, steel frame and wooden board gives it a vintage feel. You can choose to buy two bookshelves, assembled side by side like in our picture, not only very beautiful and atmospheric, but also add more storage space and add an artistic sense to your room. 【Multi-functional Storage Space】- Size: 45”L x 12”W x 55” H. This large bookshelf contains 10 cube shaped storage space. It provides ample space for your books, models, crafts, and photos, or other decorations. This corner bookshelf will be a great place to show your friends and family about your life, hobbies, or small accomplishments. 【Multiple Scenes & Divide Space】- Our 14 Shelves Bookshelf is applicable for many occasions.This bookcase provides a stylish, modern design for small spaces in a simple, modular style. It’s not only a bookcase, but also vintage decoration. it can divide your space into various areas according to your different needs and likes. With simple but elegant outlook, it will be a great decoration to your space. 【Solid Construction & High Quality】- The Corner cabinet adopts thicker iron pipes and e1 grade particleboard. The main metal structure adopts high-hardness steel to meet your load-bearing needs. The back of the corner bookcase adopts an \"X\"-shaped structure to enhance the stability of the product, avoiding the risk of shaking, guaranteed durability and stability. 【Easy to Assemble & 100% Satisfaction】- The package contains all the necessary accessories and detailed instructions. You don't have to worry about assembly. At the same time, we will provide you with quality pre-sales and after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EAVMda44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAKASEPT","source_asin":"B0BQRC2MHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQRC2MHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQRC2MHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
