window.products.push({"id":909618,"name":"Nice & Nature Acacia Wood Serveware Round Plate Small, Acacia 6\" Plate, Acacia Cocktail Plate, Acacia Wood Serving Tray Set, Dessert Plates 6 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u+Uyb2ZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Richly grained acacia wood turns out in smooth, sculptural serving essentials, naturally suited to everyday use, entertaining or artful display. Each piece is given a clear lacquer finish to bring out the wood's warm color and individual markings. Workmanship from well-managed forests in Thailand. Nice & Nature Wood Plate - Round - Acacia. This charming Wood plate is perfect for everyday use and entertaining for that perfect party. Each piece has been workmanship from laminated piece of hardwood making each item unique in shape, color and the highest quality available. Acacia wood also known as Acacia is an environmentally friendly hardwood that is grown all over the world and known for its beautiful grain and contrasting walnut brown to light tan colors. Nice & Nature product is the locally made product of each Thai Tambon (sub-district). It consisted of OTOP (One Tambon one Product). The reason that we would like to promote our brand because to support local people have job to do and can work at home as a homemade. It’s like a family business so that they can work and then stay with their family.We encourage village communities to improve the local products' quality and to join e-commerce project. Nice & Nature has been a leading importer of responsibly produced and environmentally friendly Acacia wood, a wide collection of casual entertaining items and our popular Acacia. Our products are exclusively from Thai Tumbon. Our varied collection of items made from Acacia wood, are perfect for any indoor outdoors party or just for your own dining pleasure. Whether you're looking for a gift to give or a gift for yourself; whether you're looking for something for special occasions or every day use, our product is an exceptional choice- the exquisite craftsmanship, nice color and natural design will make a special occasion out of any occasion. Our product also means \"easy care\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u+Uyb2ZwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nice & Nature","source_asin":"B010VTKZYA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010VTKZYA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010VTKZYA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
