window.products.push({"id":909625,"name":"SUPER MARIO Nintendo Advent Calendar Christmas Holiday Calendar with 17 Articulated 2.5” Action Figures & 7 Accessories, 24 Day Surprise Countdown wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yjCpv4AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nintendo launched its first console in North America in 1985, and the rest is video game history. Nintendo has sold more than 4. 7 billion video games globally, including the popular Super Mario Bros. Franchise. Mario has since gone on to star in many more gaming adventures, allowing him to evolve into the beloved pop-culture icon he is today. Along with his friends Luigi, Peach, Yoshi, and Toad, this classic video game Hero has an enduring appeal for fans of all ages. Explore the Mushroom Kingdom with this Super Mario Advent calendar full of surprises. Count the days down and reveal a figure or accessory Each day. Display them with the pop-up environment pieces and create your own scene. The Super Mario Advent calendar includes 24 total surprises from the Super Mario video game franchise. There are a variety of popular characters and accessories included to expand your Super Mario World. Each figure and accessory are hidden behind a numbered door so you'll never know what you'll be getting next. The unique packaging allows you to open up the front panel and use the pop-up environment pieces as a display area for your favorite items. With 24 days of surprises, This is a great holiday gift for Super Mario fans of all ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yjCpv4AQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPER MARIO","source_asin":"B07KW5B5GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KW5B5GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KW5B5GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
