window.products.push({"id":909751,"name":"AMST Vanity Mirror Makeup Mirror with Lights, Tabletop Wall-Mounted Cosmetic Mirror with Dimmable 3 Color Lighting Modes, LED Backlit Light Strip, 10X","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OO2M3f6LL._AC_.jpg","description":"【Lighted Makeup Mirror with Lighting Color Changeable】The stripe LED lights along four sides of makeup mirror will provide you 3 different lighting color: Cool white/warm white/warm yellow. With the stepless dimmer function you can also control the accurate lighting shades in various lighting condition. 【 Vanity Mirror with Touch Sensor Switch 】AMST Lighted vanity mirror with stripe LED lights is designed with 3 touch buttons on the front for you to operate. One short touch on the middle button is to turn on/off the light; One short touch on the \"M\" button is to choose different lighting color; Long press on the \"P\" button is to change the brightness gradually. These buttons of lighted mirror would respond to you quickly under the proper use and dry & clean condition. 【Light Up Mirror with USB Charging Port】Side-mounted power and USB port make it easy to use and convenient to charge your device nearby when do makeup. Adapter cord is included, so just plug in, minimal assembly required. 【Fitting Dimensions & USB Charging Port】AMST portable makeup mirror with the perfectly large size L22.8 x H18 fits for your makeup desk and decors your table more elegance. And it has A 12V 4A USB charging port designed on the side of the frame. Plug with the included adaptor and light up. It is convenient to charge your smart phone or other USB devices. 【Mirror with Two Way Display】AMST hollywood mirror with lights is Wall-Mounted or Tabletop. The stable and detachable base for easy wall mounting (wall mount kit is not included), so this lighting cosmetic mirror with dimmable Led lights can be hung on the wall as a second option. 【Perfect Gift for Friendship & Birthday】with 50,000 hours life span, this classic makeup mirror provides perfect lighting for best visibility and crystal clear and the most accurate mirror reflection. It would be the safe and durable gift for Girls or Ladies at the festivals. We are guaranteed to take fully responsibility for any defective or broken mirror bought from our store. Contact us and we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OO2M3f6LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMST","source_asin":"B0B6H2Q5YL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6H2Q5YL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6H2Q5YL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
