window.products.push({"id":909821,"name":"Ginkgo Varberg 45-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318176NT01L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description With a sophisticated mirror finish and a handle that curves out at the end, the Varberg collection from Ginkgo is sure to please. The 45-piece place setting includes four each of the following: salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, dinner spoon and teaspoon as well as a 5-piece hostess set. A perfect gift for the bride-to-be or new homeowner. All pieces are made from 18/0 stainless steel. Dishwasher safe. Made for you life. Amazon.com Simply yet elegantly designed, Varberg flatware features straight lines on the business ends-fork tines, oblong spoon bowls, and knife blade-balanced with rounded tab handles that lift gracefully off the table. Identical in shape and size to Bergen except for Bergen's satin finish, Varberg is a moderated priced pattern with a satisfying weight that suits a casual, modern lifestyle. Varberg's mirror-polish finish allows a bit more formality for special occasions. An excellent comprehensive set for a new couple or new home, this 45-piece set includes eight place settings and 5 serving pieces. Each setting contains a 9-3/4-inch dinner knife, 8-1/8-inch dinner fork, 7-inch salad fork, 7-5/8-inch soup spoon, and 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. The hostess set consists of a serving spoon, pierced serving spoon, sauce ladle, cold meat fork, and butter knife. Varberg, like most Ginkgo patterns, is made of durable 18/10 stainless steel and is safe for dishwasher cleaning, although prolonged exposure to acidic foods can cause spotting, which a stainless steel polish will remove. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 8 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: 9-3/4-inch dinner knife; 8-1/8-inch dinner fork; 7-inch salad fork; 7-5/8-inch soup spoon; 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. Serving set consists of: serving spoon; pierced serving spoon; sauce ladle; cold meat fork; butter knife. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318176NT01L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B0007ZQCS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007ZQCS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007ZQCS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
