window.products.push({"id":909871,"name":"SheetKart Tapestry Wall Hanging Traditional Mandala Indian Wall Art - Sapphire Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1va3Al2n2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring home the finest range of tapestries from the house of SheetKart. This beautiful & exclusive hippie tapestry is one of its kind made from 100 percent pure cotton in the Indian city of Rajasthan, the hub of Indian tapestries – Sanganer , Jaipur. This attractive and alluring boho hippy wall art will decorate the ceilings and walls of your home like never before. The awesome print and design in this tapestry can be an excellent item for gifting purpose & can be a perfect gift for mom , dad , brother , sister , son , daughter and in laws. These tapestries effortlessly display a fun mix between a modern bohemian style and ethnic Indian traditions. Each tapestry can be used in a variety of different ways, the possibilities are endless! This pretty and good-looking screen printed by hand tapistry will add a rich yet pleasing and an ethnic feel even to the roof of your bedroom , living area , dining room , yoga room , study room or drawing room. This exclusive tapestry has hemmed edges and is manufactured in smoke free & child free environment. The shipping package includes, one beautifully designed handcrafted Indian tapestry & unlimited happiness with it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1va3Al2n2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SheetKart","source_asin":"B01GFUB3T0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-909871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFUB3T0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFUB3T0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
